# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in what you use. .env.local is never committed.
# No key is needed for /video-short-editor or /video-cold-call-editor.
# /video-scrapbook-editor works without a key too; two are optional:
# GIPHY_API_KEY=      the real reaction GIFs (free at developers.giphy.com)
# GEMINI_API_KEY=     generated illustrations and reaction pictures (Nano Banana 2, about $0.07 each)
